# OpenFinder Environment Variables

# ── Admin account ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# There is deliberately NO admin username/password env var. The first administrator
# is created through the first-run setup wizard, and is the only account with
# host-level power (filesystem, terminal, drive mounts, SSH keys, Samba).
#
# The old ADMIN_USERNAME / ADMIN_PASSWORD login was removed: it skipped two-factor
# auth entirely, and because it created the first user without marking the instance
# initialized, it left /api/auth/setup open to anonymous account creation forever.

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 64 hex chars (openssl rand -hex 32). Encrypts SSH keys and S3 credentials at rest.
# If unset, a key is generated once and persisted to data/.app_key (mode 0600).
# APP_KEY=

# ── Network ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# PORT=3000
# Which proxies' X-Forwarded-For to believe. Keep this tight: req.ip drives rate
# limiting, so a too-permissive value lets clients forge their own identity.
# TRUST_PROXY=loopback
# Extra origins allowed to open websockets / send cross-origin requests. Same-origin
# is always allowed; set this only if the frontend is on a different hostname.
# OPENFINDER_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://files.example.com
# Force Secure cookies when TLS terminates somewhere we can't auto-detect.
# OPENFINDER_SECURE_COOKIES=true

# ── Limits ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES=26843545600   # 25 GiB
# MAX_JSON_BODY_BYTES=1048576    # 1 MiB
# MAX_TERMINAL_SESSIONS=8

# ── Storage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Filesystem root exposed to administrators. Defaults to '/' in production.
# ROOT_DIR=/
# Isolated directory tree that may be exported through Samba.
# OPENFINDER_SAMBA_ROOT=/mnt/openfinder-storage
# Additional directories that may be shared. Separate Linux paths with `:`.
# Keep this list narrow; every folder below an allowed root becomes shareable by
# an OpenFinder administrator. Example:
# OPENFINDER_SAMBA_ALLOWED_ROOTS=/home/abdullah:/media/abdullah:/srv/shares
# SAMBA_CONF_PATH=/etc/samba/smb.conf
# Optional: SQLite database path (defaults to ./data/filemanager.db)
# DATABASE_URL=./data/filemanager.db

# ── Optional: bundled Coolify sidecar ────────────────────────────────────────
COOLIFY_ENABLED=true
COOLIFY_APP_PORT=8000
COOLIFY_DATA_DIR=/data/coolify
COOLIFY_BUILD_LOCAL=false
COOLIFY_IMAGE=ghcr.io/coollabsio/coolify:latest
COOLIFY_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
COOLIFY_API_TOKEN=your_coolify_bearer_token
